{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"十年春，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"齊人歸我濟西田。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"夏四月丙辰，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"己巳，齊侯元卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"齊崔氏出奔衛。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"公如齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"五月，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"癸巳，陳夏徵舒弒其君平國。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"六月，宋師伐滕。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"公孫歸父如齊。葬齊惠公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"晉人、宋人、衛人、曹人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"秋，天王使王季子來聘。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"公孫歸父帥師伐邾，取繹。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"大水。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"冬，公孫歸父如齊。齊侯使國佐來聘。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"饑。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_21","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_22","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"十年春，公如齊。齊侯以我服故，歸濟西之田。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_23","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"夏，齊惠公卒。崔杼有寵於惠公，高、國畏其偪也，公卒而逐之，奔衛。書曰「崔氏」，非其罪也，且告以族，不以名。凡諸侯之大夫違，告於諸侯曰：「某氏之守臣某，失守宗廟，敢告。」所有玉帛之使者則告，不然則否。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_24","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"公如齊奔喪。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_25","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"陳靈公與孔寧、儀行父飲酒於夏氏，公謂行父曰：「徵舒似女。」對曰：「亦似君。」徵舒病之。公出，自其廄射而殺之。二子奔楚。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_26","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"滕人恃晉而不事宋，六月，宋師伐滕。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_27","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"鄭及楚平。諸侯之師伐鄭，取成而還。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_28","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"秋，劉康公來報聘。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_29","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"師伐邾，取繹。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_30","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"季文子初聘于齊。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_31","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"冬，子家如齊，伐邾故也。國武子來報聘。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_ttr_124_32","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_124","textTraditional":"楚子伐鄭。晉士會救鄭，逐楚師于潁北。諸侯之師戍鄭。鄭子家卒。鄭人討幽公之亂，斵子家之棺，而逐其族。改葬幽公，諡之曰靈。","sentenceOrder":32}],"overrides":{}}